    <title>題解｜ZeroJudge d046. 文文採西瓜</title>
    <url>/solution/ZeroJudge/d046/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<p>【題目】<a href="https://zerojudge.tw/ShowProblem?problemid=d046">d046. 文文採西瓜</a></p>
<span id="more"></span>
<h1 id="題解"><a href="#題解" class="headerlink" title="題解"></a>題解</h1><div class="tabs" id="s"><ul class="nav-tabs"><li class="tab active"><a href="#s-1">Python解法</a></li><li class="tab"><a href="#s-2">C++解法</a></li></ul><div class="tab-content"><div class="tab-pane active" id="s-1"><figure class="highlight py"><figcaption><span>d046.py</span></figcaption><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">n=<span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())</span><br><span class="line">melons=<span class="built_in">list</span>(<span class="built_in">map</span>(<span class="built_in">int</span>,<span class="built_in">input</span>().split()))</span><br><span class="line">count=<span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> m <span class="keyword">in</span> melons:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> m&lt;=<span class="number">10</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        count+=<span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(count)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div><div class="tab-pane" id="s-2"><figure class="highlight cpp"><figcaption><span>d046.cpp</span></figcaption><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;iostream&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> <span class="keyword">namespace</span> std;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">	<span class="type">int</span> n,y=<span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">	cin&gt;&gt;n;</span><br><span class="line">	<span class="type">int</span> w[<span class="number">100</span>];</span><br><span class="line">	<span class="keyword">for</span>(<span class="type">int</span> i=<span class="number">0</span>; i&lt;n; i++) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">		cin&gt;&gt;w[i];</span><br><span class="line">	&#125;</span><br><span class="line">	<span class="keyword">for</span>(<span class="type">int</span> i=<span class="number">0</span>; i&lt;n; i++) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">		<span class="keyword">if</span>(w[i]&lt;=<span class="number">10</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">			y+=<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">		&#125;</span><br><span class="line">	&#125;</span><br><span class="line">	cout&lt;&lt;y;</span><br><span class="line">	<span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div></div></div>


<h1 id="解說"><a href="#解說" class="headerlink" title="解說"></a>解說</h1><p>這題說穿了，就是要你找出陣列中&lt;&#x3D;10的數值的數量，所以該怎麼做呢？</p>
<div class="tabs" id="t"><ul class="nav-tabs"><li class="tab active"><a href="#t-1">Python解法</a></li><li class="tab"><a href="#t-2">C++解法</a></li></ul><div class="tab-content"><div class="tab-pane active" id="t-1"><p>首先我們令一個變數n來接第一行輸入，也就是要採收的西瓜的數量<br>再來，我們令一個list，名叫<code>melons</code>，負責用來記錄西瓜重量，至於<code>map</code>，我們曾在<a href="/solution/ZeroJudge/c004/#%E8%A7%A3%E8%AA%AA">這篇</a>提及，這裡我們再來看一下他在這裡的應用：<br>這裡，他是把一大串的輸入（如<code>1 3 5 7 9 11</code>）一個一個分開、遇到空格就把他們分開…<code>split()</code><br>然後，把分開後的，一個個轉為int型態…<code>map(int,input().split())</code><br>再然後，把他們變成一個list…<code>list()</code><br>接著，我們就可以找&lt;&#x3D;10的數啦！<br>我們用for迴圈遍歷陣列，遇到&lt;&#x3D;10的數字，就把用來記錄數量的變數<code>count</code>+1<br>最後，再輸出<code>count</code>即為所求！</p></div><div class="tab-pane" id="t-2"><p>首先，我們令一個變數n，用來接收第一行輸入，也就是要採收的西瓜的數量<br>然後，我們再宣告一個長度為100的array（這裡選100是因為輸入說明有提到西瓜數量不大於100）<br>用for迴圈，將數值一個一個輸入到陣列中<br>接著，就是要找出&lt;&#x3D;10的數值的數量！<br>用for迴圈遍歷陣列，當遇到&lt;&#x3D;10的數字，用來計數的變數<code>y</code>就+1<br>最後，再輸出<code>y</code>即為所求！</p></div></div></div>

<h1 id="結語"><a href="#結語" class="headerlink" title="結語"></a>結語</h1><p>今天這題主要利用迴圈、if來解題！<br>以上就是今天的題解，倘內容有誤或仍有疑問，歡迎在下方留言區留言！</p>
]]></content>
