    <title>題解｜ZeroJudge d068. 該減肥了！</title>
    <url>/solution/ZeroJudge/d068/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<p>【題目】<a href="https://zerojudge.tw/ShowProblem?problemid=d068">d068. 該減肥了！</a></p>
<span id="more"></span>
<h1 id="題解"><a href="#題解" class="headerlink" title="題解"></a>題解</h1><figure class="highlight py"><figcaption><span>d068.py</span></figcaption><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">w=<span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(w-(w&gt;<span class="number">50</span>))</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h1 id="解說"><a href="#解說" class="headerlink" title="解說"></a>解說</h1><p>這題的意思其實就是，顧客入店時的體重是否&gt;50，是的話輸出就是<code>原體重-1</code>，否則輸出原體重<br>好，那在使用<code>if</code>的情況下，我們的程式也許會長得像這樣…</p>
<figure class="highlight py"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">w=<span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> w&gt;<span class="number">50</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(w-<span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(w)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>但今天題目提示區有提到，不用<code>if</code>，我們能解出本題嗎？</p>
<p>可以。</p>
<p>我們來看一下本題題解</p>
<figure class="highlight py"><figcaption><span>d068.py</span></figcaption><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">w=<span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(w-(w&gt;<span class="number">50</span>))</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>當我們寫出<code>w-(w&gt;50)</code>時，若<code>w&lt;=50</code>，那這是<code>False</code>，而在Python中，<code>False</code>換成<code>int</code>型態時是0</p>
<figure class="highlight py"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="literal">False</span>))</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>輸出為<code>0</code></p>
<p>反之，若w&gt;50，則為<code>True</code>，轉換為<code>int</code>時為1</p>
<figure class="highlight py"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="literal">True</span>))</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>輸出為<code>1</code></p>
<p>因此，我們可以利用此一性質，寫出本題<br>就安心寫下<code>print(w-(w&gt;50))</code>，Python會自動將<code>bool</code>轉為<code>int</code>。</p>
<h1 id="結語"><a href="#結語" class="headerlink" title="結語"></a>結語</h1><p>以上就是本題題解，本題除複習比較運算子，也練習了Python中<code>True</code>、<code>False</code>轉換為整數<code>1</code>、<code>0</code>的特性，方便在運算中省略<code>if</code>。<br>倘內容有誤或仍有疑問，歡迎在下方留言區留言！</p>
]]></content>
